# Results Summary

## Key Findings
- 2025 sales showed improvement compared to 2024
- Peak sales performance occurred during November
- Event periods produced stronger overall sales activity
- Year-over-year analysis revealed noticeable performance trends across multiple months
- Data discrepancies and trends were identifiable through SQL aggregation and filtering techniques

## Skills Demonstrated
- SQL querying
- Data aggregation
- Trend analysis
- Business reporting
- Data visualization
- CSV data imports
- Structured data analysis

## Overall Outcome
This project demonstrates the ability to organize, query, analyze, and interpret retail sales data using SQL and supporting business analysis tools.
